(Oceanic Fleet Technical Procurement - Commercial Terms and Pricing Framework) '
(Document Ref: OML-PROC-POL-01 | Classification: Commercial In-Confidence) '
(Section 1: Commercial Payment and Settlement Terms) '
(Standard commercial payment terms: Net 30 calendar days from bill of lading date.) '
(Early payment cash discount: 2% settlement discount on total invoice amount if full payment is remitted within 10 calendar days.) '
(Minimum purchase order threshold: Small order processing fee of $75 is assessed on purchase orders under $500 total value.) '
(Currency of settlement: All purchase orders and commercial invoices are denominated in United States Dollars \(USD\).) '
(Restocking fee for returned items: 15% handling fee on approved returns of non-defective parts within 30 days of delivery.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
