BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 740 Td
14 TL
(Section 2: Volume Discount Schedules and Warranty Provisions) '
(Volume discount tier 1: 5% discount on catalog line items for single-order values between $5,000 and $14,999.) '
(Volume discount tier 2: 10% discount on catalog line items for single-order values between $15,000 and $29,999.) '
(Volume discount tier 3: 15% discount on catalog line items for single-order values of $30,000 or greater.) '
(Warranty for mechanical parts \(Valves, Pumps, Turbochargers, Seals\): 12 months from vessel installation or 4,000 operating hours, whichever occurs first.) '
(Warranty for electronic components \(Instrumentation and Actuators\): 24 months full manufacturer warranty from delivery date.) '
(Consumables warranty \(Filters and Gaskets\): 6 months storage shelf life warranty prior to installation.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
